      "solution": "Ta có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>cos</mo><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mo>cos</mo><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>cos</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tĐặt <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>cos</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>. Xét hàm số <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>u</mi></mrow></semantics></math> trên đoạn <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tTa có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tTính các giá trị: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mo>±</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>∓</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tDo đó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (khi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>) và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (khi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>). Vậy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>M</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.",
